      "rationale": "Useful root-cause axis and correctly uses 'not_present' for silent rows (feature request). However several values assert mechanisms the text does not support: CS-0001 labeled configuration_error though text only describes a duplicate line item; CS-0003 labeled resource_exhaustion when a 502 could stem from many causes and the text is silent; CS-0002 configuration_error where the customer only 'suspects' an SSO push. Confident specifics on silent rows lower groundedness."
    },
    {
      "name": "resolution_action_type",
      "analytical_usefulness": 0.82,
      "source_groundedness": 0.72,
      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "Adds an actionable axis (what fix is needed) that is not redundant with category. Mostly warranted inferences (feature_implementation for enhancement, urgent_incident_response for outage, billing_credit_audit for invoice fix). Slightly speculative since tickets describe problems not resolutions, but the inferred action types are reasonable projections of the request."
    }
  ],
  "analytical_usefulness": 0.9,
