  "rationale": "All four columns give distinct, non-redundant analytical axes (issue kind, product area, root cause, resolution action) that meaningfully support answering what the tickets are about and how they cluster. Groundedness is strong for issue_category and product_area, but weaker for root_cause_mechanism where several confident specific causes are asserted on rows where the source text is silent or only speculative. Correct use of 'not_present' for silent rows is noted positively."
}

